    lines+=['', 'The actual maintenance inventory is1785/1298/1785/1298 logical RPCs:975/488 chunk reads,801 event reads and nine serial Prepare/ACK barriers per cohort. Exact descriptor/offset/hash assembly, immutable writer bytes, event continuity and ACK targets pass for every prefix. The chunk read count falls by487; event fetch count stays fixed. Caller RPC timing includes scheduling, transport, recorded/quorum commit, service, reply and evidence writes; these totals do not identify pure fsync cost.','', 'All four use source `'+release['sourceCommit']+'`, actual code fingerprint `'+fp+'`, profile `'+profile+'`, frozen release SHA `'+release_sha+'`, business batch4, W128/Q64, pending128, leader0/term0, sync2, ports42000, MTU1248, event page16 and one common finite admission envelope. The selected chunk and fresh lineage/time origins are the intended differences. Actual JAR/class-source, process, native archive and unchanged protected original57-file/989-file PG checks pass in each round.','', 'Actual receiver Image lifecycle/geometry and association counters are reconciled with complete raw reply totals. The raw tape has no Image-ID field: per-callback actual Header/Image validation is source enforced and independently checked at the aggregate level. No ingress-default receiver geometry or independent packet-to-Image reconstruction is claimed.','', 'Each round preserves the full closed JOB and strict staged source allowlist, complete outer/nested file SHA/bytes/mode/uid/gid/empty-directory closure, raw tapes, CSVs, telemetry and actual artifacts. Round2 includes the approved prior-collection gate and its before.priorRound binding; it did not run until root independently approved round1. Per-round local completion receipts, native/raw audit reports and full inventories remain in `round-1` and `round-2`. `comparison.json` includes every exact comparison input SHA plus all130 raw-audit input bindings (65 per round), paired ratios, full RPC kind metrics, queues, three drain definitions and explicit limitations. The builder and execution receipt are retained in `comparison-build-r1`.','', 'Only two ordered repetitions were observed, with no randomization or confidence interval. Both6144 cohorts still complete only6141 of6400 replies inside12.8s and require additional drain. Four fresh lineages are four separate finite observations; they do not prove cumulative endurance,100M orders/s,100M connections,100M retained orders, zero latency, independent-host durability or a sustained500/s SLA. No legacy cohort is mixed into this comparison.']
